              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa achienderera kugomba achiamba, “Dza vira Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, arivyoapira akare enu, Burahimu, Isaka na Jakobo, iye andakuphani tsi yenye midzi mikulu na minono ambayo mwimwi tamuyaidzenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyumba zindakala zikaodzala vitu vinono-vinono ambavyo tamyaviika mwimwi. Kundakala na visima ambavyo tamyavitsimba na minda ya mizabibu na mizaituni ambayo tamyaiphanda. Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiphokuphirikani kpwenye tsi iyo ambako mundakala na chakurya chosi mlondacho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakikishani kukala tamundamyala Mwenyezi Mlungu yekutuluzani kula Misiri ambako kala mu atumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 4:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 4:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muogopheni Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlunguo, umuhumikire iye macheye na kuapa kpwa kuhadza dzinare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msilunge milungu yanjina, milungu ya atu anaokala jirani namwi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu, anayekala kahi yenu, ni Mlungu mwenye wivu, sedze akakutsukirirwani naye akakuangamizani tsetsetse duniani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
