        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siku zedzazo, ana enu ndiphokuuzani, ‘Zino shuhuda, shariya na masharuti ambago Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu, wahuamuru huhende manage nini?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundaajibu hivi, ‘Swiswi hwakala atumwa a Farao ko Misiri naye Mwenyezi Mlungu achihutuluza kula Misiri na uwezowe mkpwulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hwamuona na matso gehu enye achihendera tsi ya Misiri, Farao na atumishie osi ishara na maajabu ambago kala ni makulu na ga kutisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahulavya Misiri, achihureha hipha na kuhupha tsi hino, kama arivyoapa kuapha akare ehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Mwenyezi Mlungu achihuamuru kugbwira masharuti higa gosi ili humuogophe. Hino ni kpwa fwaida yehu enye wakati wosi, ili aphahe kuhuika moyo siku zosi dza anavyohenda hata rero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napho hundahenda chadi cha kutimiza shariya zosi mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu, dza vira arivyohuamuru, iyo ndiyo ndiyokala haki yehu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
